    "texture": "night, a faint film grain"
  },
  "shotRules": {
    "pacing": "fast",
    "cutFrequency": "One fact per shot: a new shot on every sentence, plain cuts.",
    "camera": "One slow push per scene, the street or room behind moves less than what is in front. The scene owns it, not the channel's Motion profile.",
    "characters": "Faceless figures glowing in one accent color, drawn by code. Never a recognizable real person. Never a weapon, blood or violence: an event is implied by a light flash and a sound.",
    "sound": "No transition sounds. Under a light flash, one dull distant sound made by code. The narration carries the video, the music sits under it."
  },
